---
layout: base.njk
title: "Berita & Pengumuman Desa"
permalink: "/berita/index.html"
description: "Kabar terbaru, informasi kegiatan, dan pengumuman resmi dari Pemerintah Desa Kemiri."
---

<!-- Header Section -->
<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-900 to-slate-900 text-white py-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-4">
    <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
      Kabar Terkini Desa
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Berita & Informasi Desa Kemiri</h1>
    <p class="text-emerald-100 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Dapatkan kabar terbaru, pengumuman publik, dan ragam kegiatan masyarakat Desa Kemiri.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- News Grid Section -->
<section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 min-h-[60vh]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    {% set beritaList = collections.berita | reverse %}

    {% if beritaList and beritaList.length > 0 %}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {% for post in beritaList %}
          <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group">
            
            <!-- Thumbnail Image -->
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="relative h-52 overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 block">
              {% if post.data.cover_image %}
                <img src="{{ post.data.cover_image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
              {% else %}
                <div class="w-full h-full bg-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg">
                  Desa Kemiri
                </div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="absolute top-3 left-3">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-600 text-white shadow">
                  Berita
                </span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Content Card -->
            <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span>{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
                  {% if post.data.author %}
                    <span>•</span>
                    <span>{{ post.data.author }}</span>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors line-clamp-2 leading-snug">
                  <a href="{{ post.url }}">
                    {{ post.data.title }}
                  </a>
                </h2>

                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                  {{ post.data.excerpt }}
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Read More Link -->
              <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
                <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-200">
                  <span>Baca Selengkapnya</span>
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
                  </svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

    {% else %}
      <div class="text-center py-16 px-6 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 max-w-md mx-auto shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-2xl font-bold">
          📰
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Belum Ada Berita</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Belum ada artikel berita atau pengumuman yang diterbitkan saat ini. Silakan kembali lagi nanti untuk mendapatkan pembaruan informasi Desa Kemiri.
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

  </div>
</section>
